#, fuzzy
msgid "Today we're proud to announce our quarkus.io Japanese localization site (https://ja.quarkus.io[https://ja.quarkus.io]) is now open. It is where our valuable guides and blog entries are translated."
msgstr "今天我们很自豪地宣布，我们的quarkus.io日语本地化网站 link:https://ja.quarkus.io[（https://ja.quarkus.io）] 已经开放。它是我们宝贵的指南和博客条目的翻译地。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Some contents have not been translated yet, but we are continuing to translate them one by one.\n"
"We are working on the localization of the contents on a GitHub public repository (https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io[https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io]),\n"
"and we are welcoming pull-requests to translate them.\n"
"If you are interested in localizing quarkus.io, come and join us!\n"
"For more details about how to contribute the localization project, please see https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io/blob/master/translation-guide.ja.md[translation guide(ja)]."
msgstr "有些内容尚未翻译，但我们会继续逐一翻译。我们正在 GitHub 公共仓库（ link:https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io[https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io）] 上进行内容的本地化工作，并欢迎大家提出翻译请求。如果你对本地化 quarkus.io 感兴趣，请加入我们！有关如何为本地化项目做出贡献的更多详情，请参阅 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/ja.quarkus.io/blob/master/translation-guide.ja.md[翻译指南（ja）] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We hope https://ja.quarkus.io[https://ja.quarkus.io] will be of great help to the user community in Japan."
msgstr "我们希望 https://ja.quarkus.io 能够为日本的用户群体提供极大的帮助。"
